              <div class="os__screen" data-os-screen="2">
                <h3 class="os__sn"><b>3.0</b> Auditoría y Conteos</h3>
                <p class="os__desc">Conteos físicos “a ciegas”. El sistema cruza conteo vs. stock teórico y alerta discrepancias.</p>
                <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="mock__bar"><span>Conteo a ciegas</span><span class="mock__id">Bodega Central · #C-118</span></div>
                  <div class="mock__body">
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Aceite vegetal 1L</span><span class="count"><em>74</em><i class="count__ok">✓ 74</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Café grano 1kg</span><span class="count"><em>26</em><i class="count__ok">✓ 26</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Azúcar 5kg</span><span class="count"><em>18</em><i class="count__ok">✓ 18</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Harina 25kg</span><span class="count"><em>9</em><i class="count__ok">✓ 9</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Maní salado</span><span class="count"><em>5</em><i class="count__bad">⚠ teórico 6</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Servilletas (caja)</span><span class="count"><em>120</em><i class="count__ok">✓ 120</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Aceite de oliva 500ml</span><span class="count"><em>12</em><i class="count__ok">✓ 12</i></span></div>
                    <div class="mock__alert">Discrepancia detectada · −1 unidad · ajuste requiere autorización</div>
                    <div class="mock__total"><span>Conciliación del conteo</span><strong>96%</strong></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="os__screen" data-os-screen="3">
                <h3 class="os__sn"><b>4.0</b> Ingeniería de Menú</h3>
                <p class="os__desc">Recetas estandarizadas y centralizadas para asegurar el costo teórico de su producción.</p>
                <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
                  <div class="mock__bar"><span>Receta · BOM</span><span class="mock__id">Roll California</span></div>
                  <div class="mock__body">
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Arroz grado sushi · 120 g</span><span>$310</span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Salmón fresco · 60 g</span><span>$590</span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Palta · 40 g</span><span>$180</span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Nori · 1 hoja</span><span>$160</span></div>
                    <div class="mock__row"><span>Sésamo · 5 g</span><span>$40</span></div>
                    <div class="mock__total"><span>Costo teórico por porción</span><strong>$1.280</strong></div>
                    <div class="mock__sub">Costeo por plato</div>
                    <ul class="oclist" role="list">
                      <li class="ocrow"><span class="ocrow__prov">Roll California</span><span class="ocrow__amt">$1.280</span><span class="badge badge--ok">32% margen</span></li>
                      <li class="ocrow"><span class="ocrow__prov">Ramen Tonkotsu</span><span class="ocrow__amt">$2.140</span><span class="badge badge--ok">41% margen</span></li>
                      <li class="ocrow"><span class="ocrow__prov">Gyozas (6 u)</span><span class="ocrow__amt">$890</span><span class="badge badge--warn">21% margen</span></li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
